   "title": "房子的哪个部分让你的生活更轻松？",
   "texts": [
    "/ideas/home-furnishings/xue2-xi2-xin1-shou3-yi4-yong4-shu1-cai4-gei3-chuang1-lian2-ran3-se4-yi3-ji2-gei3-mu4-zhi4-jia1-ju4-shang4-se4-pub4b097570",
    "NO",
    "ikea://cms/page-compatible-web?url=%2Fideas%2Fhome-furnishings%2Fxue2-xi2-xin1-shou3-yi4-yong4-shu1-cai4-gei3-chuang1-lian2-ran3-se4-yi3-ji2-gei3-mu4-zhi4-jia1-ju4-shang4-se4-pub4b097570&key=cn--zh--4b097570ff5b11ebb3f0b12fb8a4595c",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"/ideas/home-furnishings/xue2-xi2-xin1-shou3-yi4-yong4-shu1-cai4-gei3-chuang1-lian2-ran3-se4-yi3-ji2-gei3-mu4-zhi4-jia1-ju4-shang4-se4-pub4b097570\",\"objectType_var\":\"cms/page-compatible-web\"}",
    "“目前我们家洗衣篮能空着的时间最多也就15分钟，可以说洗衣房改变了我们的生活。从分类、洗刷和浸泡，到洗涤、烘干和熨烫——洗衣房可以统统搞定。上周末我们还在这里给窗帘染色呢！”",
    "房子的哪个部分让你的生活更轻松？"
   ],
